## Tests
1. Unit tests above pass; existing suite still passes.
2. Proxy configs resolve to distinct hashes; ssl control matches raw behavior.

## Experiment matrix (Claude runs on host GPU)
CIFAR-100 proxy, seed 20260714, 10 rounds. Runs: (control) client_objective=ssl [= raw 3.81%];
(candidate) client_objective=supervised. Optionally ssl_supcon if time. Measure end-to-end val AND
